  "description": "A managed, ardopcf-compatible ARDOP 1 virtual TNC for .NET: the 4FSK/4PSK/8PSK/16QAM modulator and demodulator, Reed-Solomon FEC frames, the full ARQ engine (bandwidth negotiation, gearshift) and a byte-compatible TCP host interface, so Winlink hosts (Pat, Winlink Express, ARIM, hamChat) connect unmodified. Drive it from any audio device via the M0LTE.Radio.Audio seam. Extracted from the pdn-soundmodem packet-radio modem; validated bidirectionally against ardopcf.",
